['uncertain cause shoulder','My left shoulder hurts for 4 days. I am not sure why, maybe I slept on it wrong. Bigger movements hurt and resting it helps.',x=>x.t.family==='shoulder'&&x.t.side==='left'&&x.t.duration.value===4&&x.t.relievers.includes('reducing provoking activity')]
